## Acceptance Criteria

Технические критерии приёмки (дополняют пользовательские из user-spec).

<!-- RECEIPTS RULE: "done" is a re-runnable command, not a sentence.
     Every criterion MUST carry a `verify:` line — a concrete command with an expected outcome.
     /done re-runs every verify command and records hit/miss to receipts.md; a miss blocks finalization.
     A criterion that genuinely cannot be checked by a command gets `verify: manual — <what the user checks>`.
     Use manual sparingly — if most criteria are manual, the criteria are too vague. -->

- [ ] AC-1: Все тесты проходят (unit, integration если есть)
  - verify: `npm test` → exit 0
- [ ] AC-2: API возвращает корректные коды ответов
  - verify: `curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" localhost:3000/api/users` → `200`
- [ ] AC-3: Миграции БД применяются и откатываются без ошибок
  - verify: `npm run migrate:up && npm run migrate:down && npm run migrate:up` → exit 0
- [ ] AC-4: {criterion}
  - verify: `{command}` → {expected outcome}

